      "updated": 1788390423878,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "FR:\n- The system continuously consumes photos and metadata from the Instagram Firehose via TCP\n- The system detects whether my face appears in each photo\n- When my face is detected with sufficient confidence, the system sends me an SMS alert",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "FR:\n- The system continuously consumes photos and metadata from the Instagram Firehose via TCP\n- The system detects whether my face appears in each photo\n- When my face is detected with sufficient confidence, the system sends me an SMS alert",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "pw7Ekt_pbE2lEA_2KQ-PA",
